# Agent Context: Give-A-Wonderful-Day

## Project Overview
Give A Wonderful Day - A nonprofit organization website built with Next.js.

## Key Technologies
- **Framework**: Next.js
- **Language**: TypeScript
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
- **Contracts**: Smart contracts (possibly Web3)

## Main Files & Directories
- `app/` - Next.js app router
- `contracts/` - Smart contracts
- `.next/` - Build output
- `intro/` - Introduction content
- `AI_AUTOMATION_PLAN.md` - AI automation planning

## Purpose
A website for the "Give A Wonderful Day" nonprofit organization, possibly with blockchain/donation integration.

## Notes
- Next.js based
- Has smart contracts
- AI automation plan documented
- CNAME record for custom domain
